      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales people were excessively persistent but I was attracted by the very low price and very acceptable quality of the equipment. Reviews were good although the the number of reviews was not as high as some competitors. Despite some misgivings I accepted the quote for a larger than usual (10.1 kw ) system which I thought necessary given the shadows from surrounding trees and our decision to buy an EV. Installation was quick and well done, helped by our flat site, easy access and low pitched roof. It is now a month since installation and we are very pleased with the amount of power being produced. Often it is up to 8 kw (the max possible) for several hours (on sunny days). We expect the system to pay for itself in 3-4 years, maybe earlier if electricity prices continue to rise. The only downside we experienced was the difficulty in connecting with the Growatt Inverter app. The Growatt technician and the SunSelect reps were very patient and eventually we made the connection to our wifi system, which now works well.",
