      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales staff (Oscar) was very patient over the extended negotiation process (I took a lot of time deciding which way to go with so many choices out there). I put off committing to the deal for months after paying a $100 deposit. But when I did, they booked the installation date within a week. There was a bit of a hiccup after two of the panels feel and broke as they were unloading them. Their contracted installer was honest in telling me about it and promised to come back in a couple of days to put in the last two panels. It took a week but they got it done and now our system is fully running and it is working well. I compared notes with a friend who also has a 13.2kW system. Ours generated 79.5kWh yesterday (October 17, 2023) while theirs (one year older, maybe needs cleaning?) apparently just did 45kWh. I has been eight days and I am happy so far.",
      "value_for_money_rating": 5.0,
