      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Everything was done very smoothly and efficiently. I was a bit unhappy about one thing, though. I have 8 panels facing east and 8 panels facing west. I didn't realise how much shade there is now on the west side of my roof due to some very tall gum trees, even though they are long way from the house. The installer didn't say anything, though they must have noticed. I would have gone ahead anyway, as I am getting half a day of power in winter and still expect to get full output in summer, when it will be most useful, for aircon.You didn't ask why I didn't use your preferred suppliers. Helio requested information via email, which I supplied, and they never got back to me. Soltek quoted a very expensive micro inverter system. When I said I had found information on the web that said they were of questionable benefit, they quoted for a standard inverter but it was still over 50% more expensive than my other quotes, for the same products. They were also slow to respond. SunSelect has very good feedback from a large number of customers and I was not disappointed with the service.",
